    "result_text": "The full suite is green. Both new acceptance tests pass along with the complete build.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the derived `contactPreference` field (`EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`) following the codebase's existing pattern for derived owner fields (`locality`, `membershipLevel`).\n\nChanges:\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` property to the `Owner` schema, typed as an enum of `EMAIL`/`PHONE`. The OpenAPI generator produces `OwnerDto.ContactPreferenceEnum`.\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/ContactPreference.java`** \u2014 new standalone helper (mirroring `Locality`) that returns `ContactPreferenceEnum.EMAIL` for a non-blank email, else `PHONE`. Kept off the mapper interface to avoid MapStruct treating it as an automatic conversion.\n3. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` expression wiring `contactPreference` to `ContactPreference.of(owner.getEmail())`.\n\nResult: `Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 `BUILD SUCCESS`.",
